### ====================================================================
### Bookstore REST API - HTTP Client Collection (SIS 1)
### Covers: CRUD endpoints, Bean Validation, Unified Error Responses, HTTP Statuses
### ====================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/v1/books

### 1. [POST] Create a valid Book 1 (Expect 201 Created + Location header)
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Clean Code",
  "author": "Robert C. Martin",
  "isbn": "9780132350884",
  "price": 42.50,
  "publicationYear": 2008,
  "description": "A Handbook of Agile Software Craftsmanship"
}

### 2. [POST] Create a valid Book 2 (Expect 201 Created + Location header)
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Spring in Action, Sixth Edition",
  "author": "Craig Walls",
  "isbn": "9781617297571",
  "price": 49.99,
  "publicationYear": 2022,
  "description": "Comprehensive guide to Spring and Spring Boot"
}

### 3. [POST] Negative Test - Validation Failure (Expect 400 Bad Request + field error list)
# Triggers: blank title, invalid ISBN format, negative price, year in future
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "   ",
  "author": "",
  "isbn": "invalid-isbn-123",
  "price": -15.00,
  "publicationYear": 2099,
  "description": "Fails validation constraints"
}

### 4. [POST] Negative Test - Duplicate ISBN Conflict (Expect 409 Conflict)
# Tries to insert a book with the same ISBN as Book 1
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Another Clean Code Copy",
  "author": "Uncle Bob",
  "isbn": "9780132350884",
  "price": 35.00,
  "publicationYear": 2008,
  "description": "Duplicate ISBN test"
}

### 5.1. [GET] Get all books with default pagination (Expect 200 OK, Page object)
GET {{baseUrl}}
Accept: application/json

### 5.2. [GET] Get books - Page 0, Size 2, sorted by title ASC (Expect 200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}?page=0&size=2&sort=title,asc
Accept: application/json

### 5.3. [GET] Get books - Page 1, Size 2, sorted by price DESC (Expect 200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}?page=1&size=2&sort=price,desc
Accept: application/json

### 6. [GET] Get existing book by ID (Expect 200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/1
Accept: application/json

### 7. [GET] Negative Test - Non-existing book ID (Expect 404 Not Found)
GET {{baseUrl}}/99999
Accept: application/json

### 8. [PUT] Update existing book by ID (Expect 200 OK)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Clean Code: A Handbook of Agile Software Craftsmanship (Revised)",
  "author": "Robert C. Martin",
  "isbn": "9780132350884",
  "price": 39.99,
  "publicationYear": 2008,
  "description": "Updated edition with new notes"
}

### 9. [PUT] Negative Test - Update non-existing book (Expect 404 Not Found)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/99999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Ghost Book",
  "author": "Unknown",
  "isbn": "9780000000000",
  "price": 10.00,
  "publicationYear": 2020,
  "description": "Should fail with 404"
}

### 10. [DELETE] Delete existing book by ID (Expect 204 No Content)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/1

### 11. [GET] Verify deleted book no longer exists (Expect 404 Not Found)
GET {{baseUrl}}/1
Accept: application/json

### 12. [DELETE] Negative Test - Delete already deleted / non-existing book (Expect 404 Not Found)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/1
